            "line": 284,
            "text": "theorem laplacian_rieszTest (i j : Fin 3) (ψ : ComplexTest) (x : Space) :\n    (∑ k : Fin 3, Comparison.partialD k\n      (Comparison.partialD k (rieszTest i j ψ)) x) =\n      -Comparison.partialD i (Comparison.partialD j (fun y => ψ y)) x"
